## Known issues

The data problems found and how they were handled: missing values versus zeros, inconsistent spelling or encoding, suspicious sentinels, truncation, totals that do not reconcile with published figures. State what the data can plausibly support (description and comparison far more readily than prediction) and what it cannot.

